+# Plain HTTP for internal hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to enforce HTTPS everywhere, with no plaintext exception, including for internal services. Internal hosts are held to the same requirement as any other host: connections to them must use HTTPS, and plain HTTP is not permitted.
